Subject: [PATCH] uradvd: Build from ffmuc fork

Build uradvd from the freifunkMUC fork on top of the Parker pin. The
fork adds per-prefix lifetimes and --state-file with reload on SIGHUP,
which the FFMUC Parker multi-site operation needs.
